{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/3","id":4435914716,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSvcS2c8AAAABCGav3A","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/3","diff_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/3.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/3.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/3","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/3/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/3/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/3/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/statuses/9fcbb813a9f4805e99b844443853bf389373d6ca","number":3,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"MAILBOX-0001: Bootstrap read-only Wolfram GitHub watcher","user":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## MAILBOX-0001\n\nImplements the read-only Wolfram GitHub watcher requested by Issue #2.\n\n### Repository files created\n\n- `tools/wolfram-agent-watcher`\n- `config/wolfram-agent-mailbox-policy.yaml`\n- `tests/test_wolfram_agent_watcher.py`\n- `launchd/com.chitakasha.agent-mailbox.plist`\n- `docs/wolfram-agent-mailbox.md`\n\n### Exact host files installed\n\n- `/Users/pavelcherkashin/ChitAkasha-Wolfram/agent-mailbox/bin/wolfram-agent-watcher`\n- `/Users/pavelcherkashin/ChitAkasha-Wolfram/agent-mailbox/config/policy.yaml`\n- `/Users/pavelcherkashin/ChitAkasha-Wolfram/agent-mailbox/state/seen/`\n- `/Users/pavelcherkashin/ChitAkasha-Wolfram/agent-mailbox/state/inbox/`\n- `/Users/pavelcherkashin/ChitAkasha-Wolfram/agent-mailbox/logs/`\n- `/Users/pavelcherkashin/Library/LaunchAgents/com.chitakasha.agent-mailbox.plist`\n\n### Test evidence\n\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v` passed 8/8 tests:\n\n1. authorized Issue accepted;\n2. wrong author rejected;\n3. wrong agent rejected;\n4. missing marker rejected;\n5. R2 rejected;\n6. malicious shell/prompt-injection text remained inert;\n7. identical repeat created no duplicate;\n8. changed body created a new digest/version while preserving the old record.\n\n`plutil -lint launchd/com.chitakasha.agent-mailbox.plist` passed. `git diff --check` passed.\n\n### LaunchAgent status\n\nLoaded in `gui/501` as `com.chitakasha.agent-mailbox`, with `StartInterval = 60`, `RunAtLoad = true`, and last exit code `0`. It is inactive between polls, as expected for a short periodic process.\n\n### Live read-only poll\n\nThe first live outbound-only poll against `pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab` recorded Issue #2 once with source SHA-256 `950e61466adc1d975f2e21f97d1956dcc5aff93fe6f936f0f1baf5c802e20033`. A repeated poll returned:\n\n```json\n{\"accepted\": 0, \"rejected\": 0, \"unchanged\": 1}\n```\n\nThe inbox contains one read-only (`0444`) JSON record and no raw Issue body.\n\n### Safety confirmations\n\n- No GitHub Issue, label, comment, repository setting, or other mailbox source state was mutated.\n- No Issue content was executed or passed to Codex/another LLM by the watcher.\n- The watcher invokes only `gh issue list` via an argument vector, never a shell.\n- No listener, webhook, tunnel, Funnel, SSH service, Tailscale service, self-hosted runner, or new credential was created.\n- PentAGI, Ollama, Colima, Tailscale, Forgejo, and Darwin were unchanged.\n- The only GitHub writes were the explicitly requested branch push and this PR.\n\n### Rollback / uninstall\n\n```sh\nlaunchctl bootout \"gui/$(id -u)\" \"$HOME/Library/LaunchAgents/com.chitakasha.agent-mailbox.plist\"\nrm \"$HOME/Library/LaunchAgents/com.chitakasha.agent-mailbox.plist\"\n```\n\nBooting out the LaunchAgent fully stops polling. The local mailbox directory can then be archived or removed separately if its immutable observation history is no longer needed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-03T18:44:07Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T18:52:34Z","closed_at":"2026-09-03T18:51:52Z","merged_at":"2026-09-03T18:51:52Z","merge_commit_sha":"fcd3945e8b76576e84db395c4eb5926ae482f4ea","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"pashamango:agent/wolfram/MAILBOX-0001","ref":"agent/wolfram/MAILBOX-0001","repo":{"id":1257706201,"node_id":"R_kgDOSvcS2Q","name":"minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","full_name":"pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","owner":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gist